00:06:40.216 --> 00:06:44.247
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:44.848 --> 00:06:50.944
<v Slow>大相撲の秋場所は、どこで始まりましたか。

00:06:51.744 --> 00:06:55.824
<v Host>In Tokyo — at the national sumo arena in Ryogoku.

00:06:56.423 --> 00:07:01.487
<v Slow>秋場所は、何日間続きますか。

00:07:02.288 --> 00:07:05.863
