00:07:06.463 --> 00:07:13.184
<v Slow>大関の霧島は、何になることを目指していますか。

00:07:13.983 --> 00:07:17.536
<v Host>A grand champion — the highest rank in sumo.

00:07:18.136 --> 00:07:26.127
<v Host>That's all for today. If you are in Japan this month, you can watch the tournament on TV every afternoon. See you next time.

00:07:26.728 --> 00:07:29.127
<v News>また明日。
